SUMMARY:Hot Shop: 30 Minute Make Your Own
DESCRIPTION:Receive a guided experience to create your own glass keepsakes in our glassblowing studio. In this hands-on class\, you will work one-on-one with an experienced instructor to create a unique piece of glass art.\nChoose between crafting a paperweight\, ornament\, pumpkin\, or cup\, then customize your piece with your choice of two colors. Learn the basics of glassblowing\, and feel free to ask questions as your instructor assists you during the entire process! All levels welcome. \nIf you would like to share this experience with others\, please book consecutive or duplicate time slots for you to each create a piece of your own. 2 spectators are welcome free of charge. \nSpectators must stay within the designated viewing area throughout the experience. \nItems will be ready to take home 24 hours after the experience. If you are unable to pick up your item\, we can ship it for an additional charge. \n*Students must be 13 years of age or older and accompanied by Parent or Legal Guardian if under 16 years of age.*
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/hot-shop-30-minute-make-your-own/2026-04-19/
