SUMMARY:Encaustic Immersion - 2 day workshop
DESCRIPTION:This class will go over the basics of encaustic painting and will explore the various options available to create a unique piece using hot wax. We will explore the use of paper\, photographs\, stencils\, organic material\, ink\, oils\, pastels and colored wax to create an expressive piece over this two day class. \nAll materials provided. Wear old shirt or apron to protect clothes.\nTeens & Adults; Beginner & Intermediate level.
