SUMMARY:April 25 Raku Firing with Paul Gisondo
DESCRIPTION:Experience the drama\, amazement\, and instant gratification of Raku in this one-day firing workshop. Bring up to 6 bisque fired pieces (vertically oriented vase and cylinder forms up to 12 inches in height preferred). We will glaze the pieces using a variety of crackle\, iridescent luster\, and matte glazes and fire the work outdoors in our brand new Laguna Raku kiln. Pieces will be removed from the red-hot kiln and quickly transferred into trash cans filled with sawdust for the reduction process to occur. Participants will go home the same day with dramatically transformed\, finished work!
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/april-25-raku-firing-with-paul-gisondo/
LOCATION:Odyssey Center for the Ceramic Arts\, 238 Clingman Ave Ext\, Asheville\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Classes
