SUMMARY:FiberFestival
DESCRIPTION:FiberFestival: A Fibershed Heritage Event & Artisan Market \nJoin Local Cloth and Hickory Nut Gap Farm for FiberFestival\, a celebration of Western North Carolina’s vibrant fiber community. This one-day event brings together fiber farmers and artists to showcase the full lifecycle of fiber — from pasture to finished product. \nBrowse handmade goods from local vendors\, enjoy live demonstrations\, music\, and delicious food\, and take part in a special Earth Day-inspired activity — all set on the beautiful grounds of Hickory Nut Gap Farm. A bar featuring local alcoholic and nonalcoholic beverages will also be available. \n📅 Saturday\, April 25\, 2026\n🕚 11:00 AM – 4:00 PM\n📍 Hickory Nut Gap Farm | 57 Sugar Hollow Road\, Fairview\, NC \nFamily-friendly and open to the public.
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/fiberfestival/
LOCATION:Hickory Nut Gap Farm\, 57 Sugar Hollow Rd\, Fairview\, 28730
CATEGORIES:Events
